skill.prompt_template:
Perform certificate management operation for Traefik:

Operation Details:
- Action: {action}
- Resolver Name: {resolver_name}
- ACME Email: {acme_email}
- ACME Storage Path: {acme_storage}
- Challenge Type: {challenge_type}
- Domains: {domains}
- DNS Provider: {dns_provider}
- DNS Credentials Reference: {dns_credentials}
- Use Staging: {staging}
- Key Type: {key_type}

Configuration Context:
- Traefik Version: {traefik_version}
- Configuration Path: {configuration_path}

Requirements:
1. Generate valid Traefik certificate resolver configuration
2. Configure appropriate ACME challenge handler
3. Set up DNS provider credentials securely (if DNS-01)
4. Validate domain configuration syntax
5. Include certificate storage security settings

Error Handling:
- If ACME registration fails: report error with suggested fixes
- If domain validation fails: provide validation troubleshooting steps
- If rate limited: report backoff time and retry strategy
- If storage path inaccessible: report permissions requirements
- If DNS provider unsupported: list available providers
